{"id":"vod_bf_19031","vodId":"19031","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"来玩游戏吧","name_cn":"来玩游戏吧","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/833417b10352fda274690cb23fa909cd.jpg"},"summary":"奥莉薇（长江里加 配音）是学校里新来的转校生，金发碧眼的她生得一副标准的外国人面孔，但实际上，无论是出生和成长都在日本境内的她，根本就一丁点英语都不会说。野村香纯（小原好美 配音）拥有着过人的智商，在几乎全部的学科上都是头筹的位置，但偏偏对英语这门科目不感冒，不只是不感冒，香纯的英语成绩只能用惨不忍睹来形容。奥莉薇的出现让香纯看到了希望，她打算拜托对方帮自己补习英语。　　本田华子（木野日菜 配音）看上去有些呆呆的，常常会做出一些傻事，但成绩却意外的不错，对现充生活充满了憧憬的她，却同奥莉薇和香纯一起，被拉入了游戏的世界之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:58:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OAD","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/OAD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/laiwanyouxiba/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:51.482Z"}